      "text": "Because the number isn't just information, it's a targeting system. Every scam that exists today gets simpler. You no longer have to guess who has savings. You look. Every confidence trick, the fake investment, the romance scam, the urgent call from someone who needs help, now starts with a number you can read from across a room. And the people at the top of the number scale become the most exposed people in the country. Rich people have bodyguards. Rich people have gates and lawyers and the ability to move. What they don't have, what none of them had until now, is the ability to be anonymous in a crowd. ",
